- 1 egg
- 1/2 cup vegetable oil (optional)
- 1 teaspoon vanilla extract

Instructions:

1. Preheat oven to 350°F (175°C). Grease an 8-inch round cookie pan with cooking spray or line it with parchment paper.
2. In a medium bowl, whisk together flour, baking powder, and salt until well combined.
