4. Gradually add in dry ingredients to the wet mixture, stirring just until combined. Do not overmix.
5. Drop spoonfuls of dough onto prepared cookie pan, spacing them about 2 inches apart.
6. Bake for 12-15 minutes, or until edges are lightly golden brown.
